import{_ as n,o as a,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 813 | Transcended Ones and Laws | Law Weaving and New-Cosmos Creation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 813 | Transcended Ones and Laws | Law Weaving and New-Cosmos Creation","no":813,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Laws","Law Weaving","New-Cosmos Creation","World-Creation"],"related":["13-Spatial-Law Dispatch System Detailed","14-Cultivation-Realm Unified Division","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0813_模块4-超脱者与法则-法则编织与新宇宙创造.md","filePath":"en/0813_模块4-超脱者与法则-法则编织与新宇宙创造.md"}'),i={name:"en/0813_模块4-超脱者与法则-法则编织与新宇宙创造.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-813-transcended-ones-and-laws-law-weaving-and-new-cosmos-creation" tabindex="-1">Entry 813 | Transcended Ones and Laws | Law Weaving and New-Cosmos Creation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-813-transcended-ones-and-laws-law-weaving-and-new-cosmos-creation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 813 | Transcended Ones and Laws | Law Weaving and New-Cosmos Creation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 13, 14, 28</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-weaving-laws-is-not-being-a-creator-god-but-being-a-cosmic-scale-engineer" tabindex="-1">Introduction: weaving laws is not being a creator god, but being a cosmic-scale engineer <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-weaving-laws-is-not-being-a-creator-god-but-being-a-cosmic-scale-engineer" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: weaving laws is not being a creator god, but being a cosmic-scale engineer&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system&#39;s imagination of &quot;creating a cosmos&quot; is: the strongest one punches apart the old world, then willfully kneads a new one — he is the god of the new world; all beings in the world he creates are profoundly grateful. This imagination turns &quot;creating a cosmos&quot; into the highest stage for personal cult. Heng Yuan Zhou completely negates this definition. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s orthodox framework, <strong>law weaving and new-cosmos creation are not a god&#39;s personal genesis, but a cosmic-scale project with Myriad Ranks&#39; common participation.</strong> The transcended one is this project&#39;s chief engineer, not the creator god; the law skeleton he weaves serves Myriad Ranks&#39; habitation and evolution, not his personal genesis thrill.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally embody in this entry: the anti-predation axiom requires new-cosmos creation not consume the old cosmos&#39; stock resources; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the new-cosmos design scheme have Myriad-Rank participation and results shared by Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires new-cosmos creation serve Myriad Ranks&#39; common uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the new and old cosmos&#39; causal boundary be strictly isolated; the law-first axiom requires the new cosmos&#39; law system itself be self-consistent and not conflict with the existing law network.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article focuses: the transcended one&#39;s concrete engineering role in law weaving and new-cosmos creation.</p><h2 id="i-new-cosmos-creation-s-four-engineering-stages" tabindex="-1">I. New-Cosmos Creation&#39;s Four Engineering Stages <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-new-cosmos-creation-s-four-engineering-stages" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. New-Cosmos Creation&#39;s Four Engineering Stages&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Spatial-Law Dispatch System Detailed (Document 13) and Cultivation-Realm Unified Division (Document 14), new-cosmos creation is not done in one step, but four engineering stages:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Name</th><th>Core Work</th><th>Participating Subjects</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Stage 1</td><td>Site selection and exploration</td><td>Explore spacetime coordinates suitable for opening a new cosmos within the multiverse structure</td><td>Transcended one + spatial-law dispatch team</td></tr><tr><td>Stage 2</td><td>Law-skeleton weaving</td><td>On selected coordinates weave the new cosmos&#39; law underlying architecture</td><td>Transcended one (Level-5 law-anchor authority) + multi-plane sovereign strong ones</td></tr><tr><td>Stage 3</td><td>Energy-circuit laying</td><td>On the law skeleton lay energy-cycle channels, establishing the new cosmos&#39; energy base</td><td>Transcended one + energy-engineering team</td></tr><tr><td>Stage 4</td><td>Ecology and consciousness access</td><td>Introduce life ecology, establish consciousness-domain interfaces, access Alaya Network</td><td>Myriad-Rank representatives + transcended one</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four stages&#39; key: <strong>the transcended one leads stages 2 and 3&#39;s law engineering, but stage 4 must have Myriad-Rank participation.</strong> The new cosmos is not the transcended one&#39;s private estate; it is a new home built for Myriad Ranks — Myriad Ranks have the right to participate in design, the right to inhabit, the right to evolve in it their own way.</p><h2 id="ii-law-weaving-s-engineering-principle" tabindex="-1">II. Law Weaving&#39;s Engineering Principle <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-law-weaving-s-engineering-principle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Law Weaving&#39;s Engineering Principle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law weaving is new-cosmos creation&#39;s most core and delicate link. It is not &quot;write whatever law you think of,&quot; but strict engineering design:</p><ul><li><strong>Self-consistency check</strong>: every law in the new cosmos must not contradict other laws. If Law A says &quot;energy conservation,&quot; Law B may not allow &quot;creation out of nothing&quot; — the law network&#39;s interior must be logically self-consistent. This check is completed through the deduction-iteration system in Quest Sediment Domain simulation review.</li><li><strong>Compatibility reservation</strong>: the new cosmos&#39; law skeleton must reserve compatibility interfaces with the existing multiverse law network — in the future the new cosmos will access the cross-plane anchor network; incompatible laws cannot connect.</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank adaptability</strong>: law design must consider Myriad Ranks&#39; different life forms&#39; survival needs — carbon-based life needs material plane physical laws; energy-condensed clans need energy-layer law support; consciousness-information clans need consciousness-domain law interfaces. Law weaving is not designed only for humankind.</li><li><strong>Scalability</strong>: the law skeleton may not be written dead — it must leave room, letting the new cosmos in the future upgrade law parameters as Myriad Ranks evolve, not getting stuck in civilizational development because &quot;laws are written dead.&quot;</li></ul><p>Four design requirements together: <strong>law weaving is engineering design, not artistic creation.</strong> What it pursues is not &quot;how beautiful the laws I designed are,&quot; but &quot;can Myriad Ranks live and evolve well inside.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-the-new-cosmos-and-old-cosmos-causal-isolation" tabindex="-1">III. The New Cosmos and Old Cosmos&#39; Causal Isolation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-new-cosmos-and-old-cosmos-causal-isolation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The New Cosmos and Old Cosmos&#39; Causal Isolation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>New-cosmos creation has an extremely critical causal self-discipline requirement: <strong>a strict causal isolation layer must be established between the new and old cosmos.</strong></p><p>The reason is simple: if there is no causal isolation between the new and old cosmos, then everything happening in the new cosmos will through causal threads affect the old cosmos. A cultivator in the new cosmos falling into qi deviation, a plane&#39;s laws collapsing — if these causal events conduct back to the old cosmos, they will cause unpredictable interference to Myriad Ranks&#39; survival in the old cosmos.</p><p>Causal isolation layer design:</p><ul><li><strong>Spacetime isolation</strong>: the new cosmos&#39; spacetime coordinates are completely independent of the old cosmos; between them only approved anchor channels connect.</li><li><strong>Law isolation</strong>: the new cosmos&#39; law system and the old cosmos&#39; law system are disconnected at the isolation layer, not directly interacting.</li><li><strong>Energy isolation</strong>: the new cosmos&#39; energy cycle closes inside the new cosmos, not sharing an energy pool with the old cosmos (cross-plane energy dispatch goes through anchor channels, under strict supervision).</li><li><strong>Consciousness isolation</strong>: the new cosmos&#39; consciousness domain and the old cosmos&#39; consciousness domain connect through Alaya Network&#39;s isolation buffer zone, not directly merging.</li></ul><p>The isolation layer ensures: the new cosmos is Myriad Ranks&#39; new home, not the old cosmos&#39; risk-transfer site. Problems in the new cosmos are solved inside the new cosmos; the old cosmos is not causally polluted by the new.</p><h2 id="iv-the-new-cosmos-myriad-rank-co-governance-mechanism" tabindex="-1">IV. The New Cosmos&#39; Myriad-Rank Co-Governance Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-new-cosmos-myriad-rank-co-governance-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The New Cosmos&#39; Myriad-Rank Co-Governance Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After new-cosmos creation completes, its governance power belongs to no single transcended one, but to the Myriad-Rank republican system:</p><ul><li><strong>New-Cosmos Council</strong>: representatives of each clan inhabiting the new cosmos form a council, participating in the new cosmos&#39; governance.</li><li><strong>Anchor-network access</strong>: the new cosmos accesses Alaya Network per standard procedure, accepting the same multi-layer supervision as the old cosmos.</li><li><strong>Law-revision right</strong>: the new cosmos&#39; law-parameter revision follows Myriad-Rank democratic procedure (see entry 814), not decided by the transcended one alone.</li><li><strong>Open admission</strong>: the new cosmos opens admission to all Myriad-Rank life forms — cultivators wanting to move into the new cosmos apply per standard procedure.</li></ul><p>This co-governance mechanism ensures: after the new cosmos is created, it is not the transcended one&#39;s &quot;genesis souvenir,&quot; but a new home Myriad Ranks jointly use.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: law weaving&#39;s pre-operation self-consistency check and simulation review avoid the enormous energy waste of &quot;unreasonable law design causing new-cosmos reconstruction&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: new-cosmos creation uses increment-developed spacetime coordinates and energy circuits, not consuming the old cosmos&#39; stock resources</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system, strong ones after creating a new world become its creator god; all beings are grateful; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one after weaving the law skeleton returns it to Myriad-Rank co-governance; he is only the chief engineer</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: law weaving&#39;s Myriad-Rank adaptability requirement considers all five-lineage life forms&#39; survival needs; the new cosmos opens admission to all races</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: four engineering stages, law-weaving four requirements, causal-isolation-layer design, and co-governance mechanism are all publicly queryable; Myriad Ranks may supervise the new-cosmos project</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is this batch&#39;s standard realm appellation; the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors operation compliance throughout; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law weaving and new-cosmos creation in Heng Yuan Zhou is not &quot;a creator god&#39;s personal show,&quot; but a cosmic-scale project with Myriad Ranks&#39; common participation. What the transcended one does is the chief engineer&#39;s work — he explores coordinates, weaves law skeletons, lays energy circuits, but the new-cosmos design scheme has Myriad-Rank participation, habitation eligibility is equal for Myriad Ranks, governance power is co-governed by Myriad Ranks. What he weaves is not his own god-kingdom, but Myriad Ranks&#39; new home. This is &quot;genesis&quot; at the hyper-multiverse realm&#39;s orthodox definition: not that you created the world then ruled it, but that you created the world for Myriad Ranks then returned it to them.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">Entry 13 · Spatial-Law Dispatch System Detailed</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">Entry 14 · Cultivation-Realm Unified Division</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/28-跨位面锚点连接.html">Entry 28 · Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/811_模块4-超脱者与法则-总论.html">Entry 811 · Transcended Ones and Laws Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=n(i,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,m as default};
